{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>And they grew warm.</b> This word is androgynous (of dual gender), like ויישרנה הפרות, and furthermore ארבע מלכיות מגוי יעמודנה. ותקריבנה העצמות עצם אל עצמו (and the bones approached, bone to its fellow)."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "The two scriptural citations appear with vowel points in the source (ויישרנה, יעמודנה) establishing the grammatical point about feminine plural verbs with suffixed nun; ותקרבו in the lemma vs. ותקריבנה cited may reflect the edition's normalization; translated as found."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:52.087497916Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}